{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113652","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113652/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113652/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113652/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113652","id":3700668382,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7ck7fe","number":113652,"title":"Visual Shader Color Constant/Parameter Bug","user":{"login":"whispersuntold","id":248087018,"node_id":"U_kgDODsmB6g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/248087018?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/whispersuntold","html_url":"https://github.com/whispersuntold","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whispersuntold/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whispersuntold/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whispersuntold/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whispersuntold/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whispersuntold/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whispersuntold/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whispersuntold/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whispersuntold/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whispersuntold/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-12-05T23:59:19Z","updated_at":"2025-12-21T06:58:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nTested only in Godot version 4.6 dev 4 mono\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nApparently when using a visual shader, colour constants are a wildly different colour than the exact same colour in a colour parameter. Is there some editor setting that is forcing some kind of linear of filmic, srgb something something to these variables?\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new material.\n2. Create a new spatial visual shader.\n3. Plug in a colour constant directly into the fragment albedo.\n4. Change colour to something obvious other than black or white. like a nice green or even a blue.\n5. Convert colour to parameter and observe the colour changes dramatically. It's not even subtly.\n6. And if you're lucky and you keep converting back and fourth then godot might crash. Consistently for me.\n\n\n\n7. Okay so with some more testing this also affects Coded spatial shaders too:\n\n<br/>\n//UNIFORM<br/>\nALBEDO = grassBaseColour;\n<br/>\n//CONSTANT<br/>\nALBEDO = vec3(58.0f, 122.0f, 12.0f) / 255.0f;\n\n<br/>\n<br/>\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n<img width=\"1224\" height=\"934\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d1db40e7-6fc1-416d-b7cf-03fd8b2c9938\" />\n<img width=\"1214\" height=\"932\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/713e7b21-d111-4cc0-b8b2-366adf06603a\" />","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113652/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113652/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}